  description: 'If this face-up card would leave the field, banish it instead. You
    can only use each of the following effects of "Floowandereeze & Robina" once
    per turn, and cannot Special Summon during the turn you activate either effect.
    If this card is Normal Summoned: You can add 1 Level 4 or lower Winged Beast
    monster from your Deck to your hand, then immediately after this effect resolves,
    you can Normal Summon 1 Winged Beast monster. If a Winged Beast monster is Normal
    Summoned to your field while this card is banished: You can add this card to
    your hand.'
